#, no-wrap
msgid "![Plot showing outcome probabilities for four-qubit phase estimation](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/phase-estimation-and-factoring/four-qubit-probabilities.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Plot showing outcome probabilities for four-qubit phase estimation](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms/phase-estimation-and-factoring/four-qubit-probabilities.svg)\n"
